# <%= @project_name %>

Built with [Frai](https://github.com/aasmolsky/frai) — Ruby LLM framework.

## Structure

```
tasks/       # single LLM calls — SomeTask.call(input)
pipelines/   # chains of tasks
agents/      # orchestration with tools
tools/       # Ruby wrappers around scripts/
scripts/     # executables in any language (stdin/stdout JSON)
directives/  # MD+ERB prompt templates
responses/   # LLM output parsing and validation
config/      # frai.rb — adapter, model, api_key
```

## Usage

```bash
frai console              # interactive Ruby session
frai exec SomeTask        # run a task from CLI
bundle exec rspec         # run tests
```
